{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lost, Confused, and In Too Deep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Adventures of Badgersaw\u00a0</strong>is a narrative-driven RPG filled with dry British humour, unsettling monsters, and the kind of jolly denial that comes when all hope is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After taking a wrong turn, Badgersaw and his companions find themselves trapped inside a vast alien cave. What begins as a simple adventure slowly spirals into something far stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is the goal. Surviving long enough to do so is another matter entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/6879012a053aba60b6fdd89ae3c6d3b6.avif?t=1770092442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras_big/6879012a053aba60b6fdd89ae3c6d3b6.avif?t=1770092442 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Fight and Talk your way out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badgersaw blends <strong>old-school adventure game design</strong>, <strong>JRPG-inspired combat</strong>, and <strong>visual-novel-style dialogue</strong> into a tightly paced experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hostile cave filled with strange creatures and stranger devices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles and uncover hidden paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk (or argue) with whatever inhabits the depths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit nasty creatures and furniture with your sword</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/546abc2389bac7fe31e33a266a26a2e3.avif?t=1770092442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras_big/546abc2389bac7fe31e33a266a26a2e3.avif?t=1770092442 width=800 height=188 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/b3b03faf412f5a747fcb8166d9d8ec2e.avif?t=1770092442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras_big/b3b03faf412f5a747fcb8166d9d8ec2e.avif?t=1770092442 width=800 height=188 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5ecfccc7dbdc147077e0c5715e1a105b.avif?t=1770092442\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras_big/5ecfccc7dbdc147077e0c5715e1a105b.avif?t=1770092442 width=800 height=188 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Motivation is a resource</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each party member uses a unique resource tied directly to their personality:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Badgersaw</strong> gets lost in his <strong>Malice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tantalum's</strong> potential is gated by his <strong>Motivation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mr L</strong> denies the existence of magic, but stops every now and again to recharge his\u00a0<strong>Mana</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Badgersaw can restore Motivation (and Mana) by <strong>slapping his teammates</strong> in a bold display of leadership.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.poster.avif?t=1770092442\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.webm?t=1770092442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/8a4bb61778c0f005e6c4df5606b22a96.mp4?t=1770092442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your approach</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock new abilities and equipment that let you shape how the party functions. Choose carefully\u2014wouldn't want to die, would we?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But death is part of the experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are limited, saves are scarce, and death is always close.\u00a0Each death also gives you a unique scene, so you can have fun dying, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.poster.avif?t=1770092442\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.webm?t=1770092442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/5abf4fc3eb51d3c52bd3c1cafa3a3d11.mp4?t=1770092442\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What to expect in Chapter 1</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\u20134 hours of main story content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional side content and hidden scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A self-contained chapter with ongoing story threads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Future chapters released as DLC</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore MP by slapping your teammates</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discuss mortality with a meat golem</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steal sandwiches from a child's lunchbox</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the protagonists slowly lose hope as they get lost in an increasingly strange and hopeless environment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in banter to lighten the mood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome the terrors and escape (maybe)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3340220?t=1770092442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770092442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/79e9d52e6b4b7289c46cd18af47f37f5c16d2b53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770092442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/79e9d52e6b4b7289c46cd18af47f37f5c16d2b53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770092442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3342160,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lost, Confused, and In Too Deep</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Adventures of Badgersaw\u00a0</strong>is a narrative-driven RPG filled with dry British humour, unsettling monsters, and the kind of jolly denial that comes when all hope is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After taking a wrong turn, Badgersaw and his companions find themselves trapped inside a vast alien cave. What begins as a simple adventure slowly spirals into something far stranger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape is the goal. Surviving long enough to do so is another matter entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3340220/extras/6879012